    <detaileddescription>
<para>Provides controlled access to NpuTensor implementation details.This class allows specific components to access the internal implementation of NpuTensor while maintaining encapsulation for general usage.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="warning"><para>Direct implementation access should be used sparingly and only when absolutely necessary, as it breaks the encapsulation provided by PIMPL.</para>
</simplesect>
